WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome. In this lesson you will learn
how to write a CV.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A CV is a short document that shows
employers your skills and experience.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Start with your name, your phone number
and the town where you live.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Next, list your education and any training,
like Digital Bridge.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Then describe your work experience,
starting with the most recent.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Keep it to one or two pages.
Thank you for watching.
